1079
02:06:10,539 --> 02:06:15,199
Just use more than five verbs, six verbs throughout word summary.

1080
02:06:15,920 --> 02:06:16,900
How we summarize?

1081
02:06:16,900 --> 02:06:18,699
First, you skim the text.

1082
02:06:18,699 --> 02:06:21,500
You note the subheadings.

1083
02:06:21,640 --> 02:06:25,619
If there are no subheadings, you need to divide the text.

1084
02:06:26,000 --> 02:06:31,140
Eğer parçada alt başlıklar yoksa, ara başlıklar, senin bölmen lazım.

1085
02:06:31,659 --> 02:06:36,640
Yani maddelere bir bundan bahsediyor, bir bundan bahsediyor, bir de bundan bahsediyor diye.

1086
02:06:36,760 --> 02:06:38,779
Kafanda senin bir bölmen lazım parçayı.

1087
02:06:39,239 --> 02:06:42,159
Then determine what type of text you are dealing with.

1088
02:06:42,539 --> 02:06:47,020
Is it, for example, research paper article or newspaper article?

1089
02:06:47,020 --> 02:06:52,140
And the organization problem solution, opinion, cause effect essay.

1090
02:06:52,279 --> 02:06:55,039
What type of text is this?

1091
02:06:55,720 --> 02:06:57,840
Then please read the text.

1092
