Firstly.

1107
02:07:36,600 --> 02:07:37,020
Secondly.

1108
02:07:37,300 --> 02:07:37,619
Moreover.

1109
02:07:37,940 --> 02:07:38,340
Furthermore.

1110
02:07:38,600 --> 02:07:39,659
As a final remark.

1111
02:07:40,000 --> 02:07:41,800
To sum up, use linking words.

1112
02:07:42,199 --> 02:07:43,119
Read your summary.

1113
